B.Q9=new A.cG("Welcome to the Nevada Evapotranspiration Monitoring and Education Tool \u2014 a web app designed to support community engagement with local water use data and sustainability efforts across Southern Nevada.\n\nThis platform was created to help residents, researchers, and educators easily explore real-time and historical evapotranspiration (ET) data from monitoring stations across the valley. Whether you\u2019re managing your home irrigation, studying environmental change, or simply curious about how water moves through our desert landscape \u2014 this site is here to connect you with the information that matters.",null,null,null,null,null,null)
