B.Q3=new A.cG("This system serves as a bridge between research and real life. By making environmental data accessible and understandable, we aim to:\n\n\u2022 Support smarter water use decisions\n\u2022 Raise awareness about evapotranspiration and climate\n\u2022 Promote sustainability and conservation for all\n\nThank you for visiting and being part of a more water-wise Nevada.",null,null,null,null,null,null)
